 if _a["target_ref"]=="NJS-0200-001":
  _a["use"]=PP(("对 shutdown/reboot task 限制 writer 与 runtime authority，保存 definition digest、creator、next run、target 与 approval，并在未来触发前撤销异常。","Restrict writer and runtime authority for shutdown or reboot tasks, retain definition digest, creator, next run, target, and approval, and revoke anomalies before future trigger."),("关键系统要求短期调度权限、双人批准和可从不同权日志验证的 task-to-boot 谱系。","Critical systems require time-bound scheduling authority, dual approval, and task-to-boot lineage verifiable from differently authorized logs."))
  _a["expected_effect"]=PP(("调度对象控制与长期保留关闭 writer 到结果的时间断点。","Scheduler-object control and long retention close the temporal break from writer to outcome."),("调度器或 SYSTEM runtime 不再替代原始 creator 的责任，异常未来 action 可在影响前被阻断。","Scheduler or SYSTEM runtime no longer substitutes for the original creator's accountability, and anomalous future actions can be blocked before impact."))
  _a["limitations"]=PP(("合法补丁、安装和恢复使用相同调度器，审计缺口、后端直接修改和受陷 controller 仍会绕过。","Legitimate patching, installation, and recovery use the same scheduler, while audit gaps, direct backend mutation, and compromised controllers can bypass controls."),("时钟变化、离线补跑、task ID 重用和紧急权限会改变触发时间或削弱 lineage，必须保留 definition 和 run instance。","Clock changes, offline catch-up, task ID reuse, and emergency authority alter trigger time or weaken lineage, requiring retention of definition and run instance."))
